{"text":"Maya's Hobbies","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"Hi!","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"My name is Maya.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"I have a lot of hobbies.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"I play football with my friends.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"I kick the ball and I get a goal!","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"I also play the piano.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"My favorite song is \"Happy Birthday\".","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"My favorite subject at school is English.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"My school is not far from my home.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"A Special School","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"This is a story about a special school.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"There are forty students in the school.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"Every day the students study English and music.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"At one o'clock they eat in the dining room.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"Every year the students go on a trip.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"Some students go to the sea.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"The other students wait for the bus and go to a farm.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"Dana's New Home","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"Dana is eleven.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"Her friend Noa is the same age.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"Dana has a new flat.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"There is a blue sofa in the living room.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"There is a small bathroom and a toilet.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"Dana plays the guitar in her room.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"Noa plays the guitar like Dana.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"Dana's mother is a teacher.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"She teaches music.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"Noa is coming soon to see the new flat.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"A Birthday Party","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"Tom's birthday is in July.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"The date is July 15.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"Everyone is ready for the party.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"Tom's dad makes a cake.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"He has flour, eggs and sugar.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"The cake is very sweet.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"Then the children go outside.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"They throw a ball and play games.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"Tom's friends give him candy.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"What do you do on your birthday?","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"A Present for Grandma","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"Lia lives in a small village.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"Today is her grandma's birthday.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"Lia goes to the market.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"A man sells pretty flowers there.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"Lia buys red flowers and a card for her grandma.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"The flowers are a present.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"At the end of the day, Lia is late.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"\"I'm sorry, Grandma,\" she says.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"She gives Grandma the flowers and the card.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"Then Lia sings a song.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"Grandma can hear the song.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"She is happy.","cat":"passage"},
{"text":"\"This is a special thing,\" says Grandma.","cat":"passage"},
